  "details": "I personally am a desktop user but my friends complain now and then about having to bend their neck or do something uncomfortable in order to see the menu. Is it alright if you add a toggle for a more comfortable menu display for VR users? Thank you and I hope whoever reads this, has a good day and will go drink some water because that's important.\nP.S. more comfortable might be described as centered- might be best to experiment with a few different options and have a slider for people to adjust to their preferences",
